\section{System}
We split a neural network between an edge device and a cloud server. The edge runs the early layers and transmits intermediate features. Figure~\ref{fig:split} compares end-to-end latency under three split points on a wireless link. Figure~\ref{fig:energy} shows device energy consumption as the batch size grows.
